                <p rendition="#center">Would General and Complete Disarmament Require an
                    International Police Force?</p>
                <p>The strongly predominant opinion among those in favor of general and complete
                    disarmament is that such a state of affairs would require some sort of
                    international organization with its own police force.</p>
                <p>Table 2. “Do you think that general and complete disarmament would or would not
                    require an international organization with its own policy force?”</p>
