                <p rendition="#center">Support For Nuclear Disarmament</p>
                <p>On the more specific issue of nuclear disarmament support rises to overwhelming
                    levels in the countries surveyed.</p>
                <p>Table 3. “What about nuclear disarmament? Would you favor or not favor the
                    abolition of nuclear weapons throughout the world?”</p>
