                <p rendition="#center">Is Nuclear Disarmament Possible?</p>
                <p>The widespread sentiment in favor of nuclear disarmament is not accompanied by
                    equally general feeling that such a course is possible. <pb facs="0315" n="275"
                        xml:id="pg275"/> While optimism holds an edge it does not attain a majority
                    level in any of the countries surveyed, and except in France, is almost matched
                    by the extent of pessimistic views.</p>
